  "headline": "13 Dead and 14 Trapped After Landslide at Illegal Bogor Gold Mine",
  "seoTitle": "13 Dead and 14 Trapped After Landslide at Illegal Bogor…",
  "metaDescription": "Search and rescue operations continue for 14 miners missing after a landslide at an illegal gold mine in Pongkor, Bogor, as police arrest two suspects.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "A total of 27 miners are reported as victims after a landslide occurred at an illegal gold mine located in the Pongkor region of Bogor.",
    "Search and rescue teams have recovered 13 bodies, while 14 individuals remain trapped within the site as operations face significant challenges.",
    "Authorities from the West Java Regional Police have officially named two suspects in connection with the mining tragedy."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The incident occurred in the Pongkor region of Bogor, West Java, where illegal gold mining operations, locally referred to as gurandil, have been identified as the site of a fatal landslide. Following the event, search and rescue teams have worked to locate the missing miners, though efforts remain hindered by unsafe conditions and the vertical nature of the mining shafts. In addition to the search efforts, law enforcement agencies have conducted broader investigations into illegal gold extraction activities in the surrounding area, including recent raids on clandestine processing facilities operating under the guise of agricultural sites. The West Java Regional Police have confirmed the detention of two suspects linked to the tragedy, while separate investigations have uncovered illegal gold processing operations that have reportedly been active since 2023, yielding significant illicit financial gains.",
